# The child of nested-delegate.tbl, and a machine in its own right.
# Nothing about being a child changes it.

machine Retry
initial Ready
states  Ready Waiting Exhausted
actions Attempt Elapsed Abort

Ready     | HANDLE | IGNORE | GO(Exhausted)
Waiting   | IGNORE | HANDLE | GO(Exhausted)
Exhausted | IGNORE | IGNORE | IGNORE
